1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,500
A Portuguesa (1890); Written by Henrique Lopes de Mendonça, composed by Alfredo Keil.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,700
Heroes of the sea, noble people,

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:17,000
brave and immortal nation!

4
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:21,900
Raise once again today,

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
the splendor of Portugal!

6
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:31,000
Among the haze of memory,

7
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,800
oh Homeland! One feels the voice,

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
of your distinguished forefathers!

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,500
That shall lead you to victory!

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,600
To arms, to arms!

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,500
Over land, over sea,

12
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,500
To arms, to arms!

13
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:02,300
For the country, fight!

14
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,000
Against the cannons,

15
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,500
March on, march on!